OL,3,GNEWSAHouse prices 'essentially
OL,4,Aunchanged' as sales fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew figures show average house prices
OL,7,Fhave remained "essentially unchanged"
OL,8,Fover the past 12 months, while there
OL,9,Fhas been a fall in the number of
OL,10,Fproperties sold.
OL,12,FAccording to Statistics Jersey, the
OL,13,Faverage home sold in Jersey between 1
OL,14,FJuly and 30 September 2026 cost
OL,15,F#607,000.
OL,17,FThat is the same as during the same
OL,18,Fperiod of 2025 - although it is 13%
OL,19,Flower than the peak in prices seen
OL,20,Fduring the same period of 2022.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
