OL,3,GNEWSAHouse prices 'essentially
OL,4,Aunchanged' as sales fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report shows 270 properties passed
OL,7,Fthrough Jersey's Royal Court during the
OL,8,Fthird quarter of 2026, which is fewer
OL,9,Fthan the 282 homes sold in the
OL,10,Fpreceding quarter (1 April - 30 June
OL,11,F2026).
